### T2-Actividad 2 - Catalogo de Catalogos (REST Client de VS Code)
@base = http://localhost:3050/api/v1

### 1) Iniciar sesion eligiendo la base de datos: mongodb | supabase
# @name login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "usuario": "kperez", "dbServer": "supabase" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Sesion actual
GET {{base}}/auth/session
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Lista de catalogos (filtros opcionales: collection, section, active)
GET {{base}}/catalogs?collection=trading
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Un catalogo con su arreglo values
GET {{base}}/catalogs/strategies
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Arbol maestro-detalle-detalle
GET {{base}}/catalogs/strategies/tree
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Valores de nivel 2
GET {{base}}/catalogs/strategies/values?level=2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Alta de un catalogo con valores iniciales
POST {{base}}/catalogs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "key": "order_types", "label": "Tipos de Orden", "collection": "trading",
  "section": "Operacion", "sequence": 5, "route": "/config/order-types",
  "values": [ { "code": "MARKET", "value": "A mercado", "alias": "MKT" } ]
}

### Alta masiva de catalogos
POST {{base}}/catalogs/many
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "key": "markets", "label": "Mercados", "collection": "trading" },
  { "key": "currencies", "label": "Monedas", "collection": "config" }
]

### Modificar un catalogo (la key no cambia)
PUT {{base}}/catalogs/order_types
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "label": "Tipos de Orden de Compra/Venta" }

### Agregar un valor (subdocumento / fila de catalog_values)
POST {{base}}/catalogs/order_types/values
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "LIMIT", "value": "Limitada", "alias": "LMT" }

### Agregar varios valores
POST {{base}}/catalogs/order_types/values/many
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

[ { "code": "STOP", "value": "Stop" }, { "code": "STOP_LIMIT", "value": "Stop limitada" } ]

### Baja logica de un catalogo (fisica con ?hard=true)
DELETE {{base}}/catalogs/order_types
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Baja fisica de varios catalogos
DELETE {{base}}/catalogs/many?hard=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "keys": ["order_types", "markets", "currencies"] }
